From: Christophe Guibout <christophe.guibout@st.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bootcount: mark rauc slot as good on accepted bank

Once the active FWU bank is accepted, also mark the booted RAUC slot
as good so that RAUC and TF-A bank states stay in sync.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OTA specific]

--- a/bootcount.sh
+++ b/bootcount.sh
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@
 
 if [ "${bank_state}" = "valid" ]; then
     fwumdata -s "${active_index}" accepted
+    /usr/bin/rauc status mark-good
 fi
 
 exit 0
